{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DM1", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Quotfunctor_{\\mathcal{G}/X/B} \\to \\Quotfunctor_{\\mathcal{F}/X/B}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quot-quotient}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c8e546aa05ff26cb92a832a3cea3be23804a609728b3fc6c091f93d128dbce2d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cad3890129b163e6509bfa07a8a308fbf5677110272860bae9bf0c418e19db5a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be as in the introduction to this section. Let\n<MATH_0002> be a surjection of quasi-coherent\n<MATH_0003>-modules. Then there is a canonical closed immersion\n<MATH_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7645719cd63881d9916eb5eaebee5c1ca2e5b5840048028a8a28e72512e1c5f1", "unit_id": "tag:0DP5:statement"}
